(6662715, 996783, 108580, '<td valign="top">Some might say shoehorn. I reckon give it a chance. Great shoehorn! The bird certainly is between heaven and earth and it creates magic (shade) to lure the fish right? Interesting colours and pleasing PP. Almost as if you had a strobe above him.</td>', 'Some might say shoehorn. I reckon give it a chance. Great shoehorn! The bird certainly is between heaven and earth and it creates magic (shade) to lure the fish right? Interesting colours and pleasing PP. Almost as if you had a strobe above him.', '2012-02-03 03:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6662716, 996731, 108580, '<td valign="top">Another digital masterpiece. Photographically the lake to mountain ''scape is crisp, shiny, excellent dof from front to rear. The grass plugs are weird. The draining water shows attention to detail. Yet the sun in the sky vs the sunshine on the plugs is incorrect.  Water dripping from the plugs is really only visible in the sky and barely visible across the scape. I think it should have twinkles in it refracted from the sun and that would have made them more obvious. A shower sparkle as it where. Still, I''d never be able to create this and small flaws aside, marvellous work.</td>', 'Another digital masterpiece. Photographically the lake to mountain ''scape is crisp, shiny, excellent dof from front to rear. The grass plugs are weird. The draining water shows attention to detail. Yet the sun in the sky vs the sunshine on the plugs is incorrect.  Water dripping from the plugs is really only visible in the sky and barely visible across the scape. I think it should have twinkles in it refracted from the sun and that would have made them more obvious. A shower sparkle as it where. Still, I''d never be able to create this and small flaws aside, marvellous work.', '2012-02-03 03:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6662717, 996652, 108580, '<td valign="top">Love it. Down to the little porch light and the "sneak peak" into another world due OOF leaves.</td>', 'Love it. Down to the little porch light and the "sneak peak" into another world due OOF leaves.', '2012-02-03 03:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
