(6666987, 996818, 112972, '<td valign="top">Hey Jen!  Obviously a lot of work has gone into this.  What it needs is a little shadow or at least needs a little bit of darkening of the grass under your feet so it looks less like it was pasted in there and more like it is blended in seamlessly.  The horizon needs some work too.  The grass seems fading in some areas due to usage of soft round brush.  I would have used a brush that has the shape of grass blades and used that in order to blend the grass with the white background more naturally.  Nice creation overall!  Oh and don''t forget to share the wealth too!</td>', 'Hey Jen!  Obviously a lot of work has gone into this.  What it needs is a little shadow or at least needs a little bit of darkening of the grass under your feet so it looks less like it was pasted in there and more like it is blended in seamlessly.  The horizon needs some work too.  The grass seems fading in some areas due to usage of soft round brush.  I would have used a brush that has the shape of grass blades and used that in order to blend the grass with the white background more naturally.  Nice creation overall!  Oh and don''t forget to share the wealth too!', '2012-02-08 03:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
