(6668651, 995414, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now.<br/> <br/>Ah, a Harry Potter reference. The spell to cause a person to be confused or disoriented. I like how you portrayed it here in the composition with the zoom inward or is it zooming out? See you have already caused confusion and disorientation:-) The building could very well be Hogwarts or another magical place that teaches wizardry. The person I can see as being a student given the black clothing that is akin to the black robes. The only problem is that the pink head covering looks very out of place - A simple wave of the wand..er select tool and color change or color balance would have turned it to black or brown making us think it is simply the person''s hair color.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. Ah, a Harry Potter reference. The spell to cause a person to be confused or disoriented. I like how you portrayed it here in the composition with the zoom inward or is it zooming out? See you have already caused confusion and disorientation:-) The building could very well be Hogwarts or another magical place that teaches wizardry. The person I can see as being a student given the black clothing that is akin to the black robes. The only problem is that the pink head covering looks very out of place - A simple wave of the wand..er select tool and color change or color balance would have turned it to black or brown making us think it is simply the person''s hair color.', '2012-02-09 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
