(6669214, 996718, 137576, '<td valign="top">Dropped a full .1 from 3 hours before why does this happen?? Was at 6.125 all week ends on 6.07 pisses me off, ok answer to questions it''s a bush in my garden I set out to do this in advanced hence the bush but then realised it was expert but stuck with it.</td>', 'Dropped a full .1 from 3 hours before why does this happen?? Was at 6.125 all week ends on 6.07 pisses me off, ok answer to questions it''s a bush in my garden I set out to do this in advanced hence the bush but then realised it was expert but stuck with it.', '2012-02-10 02:14:47.000000', NULL, 0),
