(6669236, 996748, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by tanguera:</b></div><hr/><i> Clean, well-lit, well-composed image, nicely edited.  And because expert is all about details, just a nit about the slightly different perspective between the bottom half and the floating portion.  The latter is angled just very slightly in the wrong direction. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Ah yes I spotted this after submission deadline. It was such a fiddly job getting the banana slices to line up I hadn''t even thought of the texture lining up. May have to re-shoot one day:)<br/> <br/>Thanks for lovely comments and useful feedback</td>', 'Originally posted by tanguera: Clean, well-lit, well-composed image, nicely edited.  And because expert is all about details, just a nit about the slightly different perspective between the bottom half and the floating portion.  The latter is angled just very slightly in the wrong direction.   Ah yes I spotted this after submission deadline. It was such a fiddly job getting the banana slices to line up I hadn''t even thought of the texture lining up. May have to re-shoot one day:) Thanks for lovely comments and useful feedback', '2012-02-10 02:39:06.000000', NULL, 0),
