(6671750, 996731, 30861, '<td valign="top">Beautifully crafted, very well done, very Uelsmann-like; and that''s a compliment.<br/> <br/><a href="//bermangraphics.com/press/jerry-uelsmann.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//bermangraphics.com/press/jerry-uelsmann.htm</a> <br/> <br/>For me the foreground doesn''t work very well with the rest of the image, is my nit. I keep trying to scope out the scale of it, it''s slightly confusing. But, all in all, a wonderful image.</td>', 'Beautifully crafted, very well done, very Uelsmann-like; and that''s a compliment. //bermangraphics.com/press/jerry-uelsmann.htm  For me the foreground doesn''t work very well with the rest of the image, is my nit. I keep trying to scope out the scale of it, it''s slightly confusing. But, all in all, a wonderful image.', '2012-02-11 17:42:14.000000', NULL, 0),
